Package: dbschemaatlas
Title: Reusable Database Schema Metadata and Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Tony", family = "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tchemit@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Extracts PostgreSQL schema metadata through application-supplied
    DBI connections, persists portable metadata snapshots, builds dependency
    models, and creates neutral HTML schema documentation and interactive
    dependency graphs. Database drivers and application branding remain the
    responsibility of consuming applications.
License: LGPL-2.1
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/dbschemaatlas/,
    https://github.com/ultreia-io/dbschemaatlas
BugReports: https://github.com/ultreia-io/dbschemaatlas/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
